   "motion": "we forward a recommendation to the Midvale City Council to approve rezoning of 24-52 W Center St and 7710S State St from Transit-Oriented Development to Transit-Oriented Development Overlay with the following findings: 1. The proposed rezoning is consistent with the goals of the 2016 Midvale City General Plan, including the 2019 Housing Plan, and 2. The land and its surrounding environs have changed to such a degree that it is in the public interest to encourage redevelopment and recognize | the changed character of the area",
